{
  "id": "6af7302d6a562d56eba78b71",
  "title": "迷子ページ問題",
  "created": 1794584636,
  "updated": 1794668059,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6af7302d6a562d56eba78b71",
      "text": "迷子ページ問題",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584636,
      "updated": 1794584636
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303c00000000003c969f",
      "text": "　漠然と、「何かこんなページがあった気がする」",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584636,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a0",
      "text": "　　過去に読んだ記憶がある",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8649b0000000000704e5b",
      "text": "　　[なんかこんなのがあった気がするけどな][who.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1794663579,
      "updated": 1794663588
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a1",
      "text": "　検索しても見つからない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a2",
      "text": "　　「これじゃない」ページが大量にヒットする",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a3",
      "text": "　手がかりはない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a4",
      "text": "　記憶違いかもしれない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a6",
      "text": "過去のページが見つからずに困っています。こんなときはどうしていますか？[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584654
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86ff90000000000e6a6e2",
      "text": "　AIに聞く→人に聞く→あきらめる[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1794666489,
      "updated": 1794666506
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7303d00000000003c96a7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584637,
      "updated": 1794584637
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8195c0000000000b42e20",
      "text": "仮説[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794644317,
      "updated": 1794644393
    },
    {
      "id": "6af819690000000000b42e22",
      "text": " 現在の井戸端メンバーは過去のページの検索をほとんどやらない",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794644329,
      "updated": 1794644388
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86a340000000000e12f29",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665012,
      "updated": 1794665012
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86a730000000000e12f2a",
      "text": "　　[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665076,
      "updated": 1794665086
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86ad20000000000e12f2b",
      "text": "　　 ページ閲覧に関していえば体感このくらいですかね",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665171,
      "updated": 1794665497
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86bef0000000000e12f2c",
      "text": "　　  更新順 5 ~ 6 割",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665456,
      "updated": 1794665485
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86bf20000000000e12f2d",
      "text": "　　  ランダム 3 割",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665458,
      "updated": 1794665479
    },
    {
      "id": "6af86bf30000000000e12f2e",
      "text": "　　  検索 1 ~ 2 割",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794665459,
      "updated": 1794665482
    },
    {
      "id": "6af869d20000000000e12f28",
      "text": "  　他には[ブラケティング]時にも軽く検索をかけてる",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794664915,
      "updated": 1794665583
    },
    {
      "id": "6af819b50000000000b42e23",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794644405,
      "updated": 1794644405
    },
    {
      "id": "6af870210000000000e6a6e4",
      "text": "　　まあ私はほとんどやらないですね……[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1794666530,
      "updated": 1794666543
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8705e0000000000e6a6e6",
      "text": "　　　古いページを積極的に見ようとはしないかも",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1794666591,
      "updated": 1794666606
    },
    {
      "id": "6af8706f0000000000e6a6e7",
      "text": "　　　関連ページ（Links & 2hop部分）で気になるのがあったら辿っていく、くらいかも　これは検索じゃないか",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1794666607,
      "updated": 1794666657
    },
    {
      "id": "6af870220000000000e6a6e5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1794666530,
      "updated": 1794666530
    },
    {
      "id": "6af875e400000000004f83cf",
      "text": "\t\t[Nrem.icon]検索はリンクを整理する時が主で、普段はほとんど使わないですね…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794668005,
      "updated": 1794668059
    },
    {
      "id": "6af875e500000000004f83d0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794668005,
      "updated": 1794668005
    },
    {
      "id": "6af7304500000000003c96a9",
      "text": "[迷子ページ]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1794584646,
      "updated": 1794584650
    }
  ]
}